  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Caribbean Agriculture and Tourism Support  (A13127)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity&#xa0;will&#xa0;support the Caribbean&#x2019;s goal of addressing Sargassum arrival on local beaches that are heavily impacting the tourism and fisheries sectors. To mitigate associated environmental and economic impacts of the Sargassum seaweed influx, the Activity supports research into technologies and value chains for the marine biomass. This will consist of an investigation of potential uses for the Sargassum&#xa0;(with a focus on agricultural uses) and causes of Sargassum arrival.</narrative>
  </description>
